<title>GERMANY: Debis sees 97 sales up, to add 1,000 jobs.</title>
<headline>Debis sees 97 sales up, to add 1,000 jobs.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz Interservices AG (Debis), the services unit of Daimler-Benz AG, on Wednesday predicted sales would rise by one billion marks in 1997 from the 1996 level of 13.5 billion.</p>
<p>Debis chief executive Klaus Mangold also said the company expected to hire an additional 1,000 staff in the course of the year.</p>
<p>Debis had a workforce of about 11,400 people this year.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
